  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Although URL can be converted to strings, but I believe adding a block to convert strings to URL would make the system more flexible. Here is a use case, say you have 48 images on Github and you want to Online Load them into VRC. Say for some reason (like maintainance), you have decided to change the name of the repository, according to the current situation we have now, this means that we have to go change all 48 URLs. If we allow URL manipulated as strings, we can have each Picture Frame (VRCImageDownloader) Connect to another GameObject (say a UIText) to grab the domain, then when we rename the repository, we just need to reenter the domain name onto the UiText, ONCE (instead of 48 times)",
